<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's stock market is closed on Friday and Saturday due to national holiday. It will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the index ended up 21.85 points or 0.34 percent at 6,458.91. Turnover was a modest T$32.79 billion.</p>
<p>-- James Peng (5080815)</p>
</text>
